    ## ✅ Demo System Populated with 4 Devices!

    ### Current Status

    **4 devices are now live**, polling every **2 seconds**:

    | Device | Unit | Register | Threshold Warning | Threshold Critical | Current Value |
    |--------|------|----------|-------------------|-------------------|---------------|
    | Tank Temperature | °C | 40001 | 28.0 | 29.0 | ~21-22°C |
    | Tank Pressure | bar | 40002 | 85.0 | 95.0 | ~44-45 bar |
    | Pump Motor RPM | RPM | 40003 | 2700 | 2900 | ~1900-2000 |
    | Environmental Humidity | % | 40004 | 65.0 | 70.0 | ~43-44% |

    ### How to Modify Configuration

    **Edit:** `backend/scripts/seed_demo_devices.py`

    Change any of these settings:
    - Device names and descriptions
    - Sampling intervals (currently 2 seconds)
    - Threshold values (warning/critical)
    - Units
    - Modbus registers

    **Apply changes:**
    ```bash
    docker exec claude-backend python /app/scripts/seed_demo_devices.py
    docker compose restart backend
    ```

    No rebuild needed - changes take effect immediately!

    ### View Results

    Access **http://localhost:8081** with `admin`/`admin`:
    - **Devices** page shows all 4 devices with ONLINE status
    - Each device updates every 2 seconds
    - Readings accumulate in TimescaleDB
    - Click **View** on any device to see live data

    **System is ready for Iteration 4 (real-time dashboard)!** 🚀
